{
  "uid": "ob1",
  "title": "Open Brain",
  "description": "The brain's requests, provider calls, store operations, jobs and Postgres, from the observability profile (SMD-1849). Provisioned from deploy/compose.yaml, so Grafana will not save a change made here: save a copy to keep one.",
  "tags": ["open-brain"],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "refresh": "1m",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Server",
        "description": "open-brain-mcp is the MCP server at /mcp, open-brain-api the REST core: each server's own service.name.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, service_name)",
          "refId": "service-var"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, service_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": "$__all"},
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "tier",
        "label": "Tier",
        "description": "A pipeline tier's brain (OB1_TIER); a stack that is no tier has none, which All includes.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, deployment_environment_name)",
          "refId": "tier-var"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, deployment_environment_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": "$__all"},
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "database",
        "label": "Database",
        "description": "This stack's Postgres's databases (its templates aside), for its rows; the brain's is openbrain.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(pg_stat_database_numbackends{datname!~\"template.*\"}, datname)",
          "refId": "database-var"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(pg_stat_database_numbackends{datname!~\"template.*\"}, datname)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": "$__all"},
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Requests — every server, per request (http_server_request_duration_seconds)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 1},
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Requests per second, by tool",
      "description": "Each request either server recorded, by door and the tool it ran: an MCP tool call's, a REST route's operation, a mirror's (a keyed /health is brain_info's). (no tool) is the rest — initialize, tools/list, a path no route serves, and a request refused at its key, whose tool the metric leaves out. The keyless liveness probe makes no point.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 1, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "label_replace(sum by (ob1_door, ob1_tool) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval])), \"ob1_tool\", \"(no tool)\", \"ob1_tool\", \"\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_door}} {{ob1_tool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Requests per second, by outcome",
      "description": "ok; refused (a refusal: the key, the input, a busy registry, a thing not found); error, stalled and cut (the server's failures); abandoned (the client left); unrun.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 1, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (ob1_outcome) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "custom": {"stacking": {"mode": "normal"}, "fillOpacity": 30}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Latency p50, by tool",
      "description": "The median request's time, from its arrival to its answer's handing over, or to its stream's end (an MCP answer, a job stream).",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "label_replace(histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, ob1_door, ob1_tool) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))), \"ob1_tool\", \"(no tool)\", \"ob1_tool\", \"\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_door}} {{ob1_tool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Latency p99, by tool",
      "description": "The 99th percentile request's time, by tool; read it beside the rate — at a few requests a minute it is the slowest request.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "label_replace(histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, ob1_door, ob1_tool) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))), \"ob1_tool\", \"(no tool)\", \"ob1_tool\", \"\")",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_door}} {{ob1_tool}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Server failures, share of requests",
      "description": "Requests whose outcome was error, stalled or cut, as a share of all; refusals are the caller's and are left out.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 17, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\", ob1_outcome=~\"error|stalled|cut\"}[$__rate_interval])) or 0 * sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "failures"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "custom": {"axisSoftMax": 0.05}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Server failures, by error type",
      "description": "Each failed request's fault code (STORE_UNAVAILABLE or FAILED) or, with neither, its outcome.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 17, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (ob1_door, error_type) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\", ob1_outcome=~\"error|stalled|cut\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_door}} {{error_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "noValue": "none"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Model provider — each embedding and chat call past the egress gate (gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 24, "w": 24, "h": 1},
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Provider calls per second",
      "description": "Embedding and chat calls the REST core made, by model; the workers' are not sent (SMD-2910), nor `server`'s.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 25, "w": 8, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_operation_name, gen_ai_request_model) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_operation_name}} {{gen_ai_request_model}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Provider latency p50 and p99",
      "description": "Each call's time to its answer, by operation.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 25, "w": 8, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, gen_ai_operation_name) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{gen_ai_operation_name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, gen_ai_operation_name) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{gen_ai_operation_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Provider failures, by error type",
      "description": "Calls that failed, by operation: the provider's status (404, 503 …), timeout, invalid_body or the runtime's code.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 25, "w": 8, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_operation_name, error_type) (rate(gen_ai_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\", error_type!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_operation_name}} {{error_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "noValue": "none"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Store — each store operation the core calls (db_client_operation_duration_seconds)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 33, "w": 24, "h": 1},
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Store operations per second",
      "description": "By the store's method name (matchThoughts, captureThought …), one point per operation, not per SQL statement.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 34, "w": 8, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (db_operation_name) (rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{db_operation_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ops"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Store latency p99, by operation",
      "description": "The 99th percentile operation's time; the statements under it are in the Postgres row below.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 34, "w": 8, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, db_operation_name) (rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{db_operation_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Store errors: refusals, faults and stops",
      "description": "Refusals are the data's: a SQLSTATE of class 22 (a value the brain's functions refuse), 23 (a constraint), P0 (a function's RAISE) or OB (the brain's own codes). Faults are everything else — the database's (08 connection, 53 resources, 57 shut down, XX internal, a bug's 42), and a database the store cannot reach, whose code is the driver's or the network's (ERR_POSTGRES_…, ECONNREFUSED). Stops are operations a server's stop cut.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 34, "w": 8, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\", error_type=~\"(22|23|P0|OB)[0-9A-Z]{3}\"}[$__rate_interval])) or 0 * sum(rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "refusals"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\", error_type!=\"\", error_type!=\"cut\", error_type!~\"(22|23|P0|OB)[0-9A-Z]{3}\"}[$__rate_interval])) or 0 * sum(rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "faults"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\", error_type=\"cut\"}[$__rate_interval])) or 0 * sum(rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "stops"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ops", "min": 0, "custom": {"axisSoftMax": 0.1}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 16,
      "title": "Jobs — each async job's body (ob1_job_duration_seconds)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 42, "w": 24, "h": 1},
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Jobs per second, by kind and error type",
      "description": "Each job that ended, by kind; error_type is set on one that failed (JOB_TIMEOUT …).",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 43, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (ob1_job_kind, error_type) (rate(ob1_job_duration_seconds_count{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_job_kind}} {{error_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ops", "min": 0, "custom": {"axisSoftMax": 0.1}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Job time p99, by kind",
      "description": "The 99th percentile job's time, by kind.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 43, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, ob1_job_kind) (rate(ob1_job_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$tier\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ob1_job_kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Postgres — this stack's own, pg-exporter every 30 s (pg_stat_statements, pg_stat_activity); the Tier variable does not apply",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 50, "w": 24, "h": 1},
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Statements by total time over the range",
      "description": "The statements that took the most time in the dashboard's range, each by its normalized text (cut to 120 characters; constants are $1, $2): total seconds, calls and the mean per call. Only among the 100 the exporter reads — those with the most time since Postgres's statistics were reset, above the tenth percentile — so one that grew costly today but is not among them is missing. Every role's statements but the exporter's own.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 51, "w": 24, "h": 9},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "topk(15, sum by (queryid) (increase(pg_stat_statements_seconds_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__range])) * on (queryid) group_left (query) topk by (queryid) (1, max by (queryid, query) (pg_stat_statements_query_id_total)) ^ 0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (queryid) (increase(pg_stat_statements_calls_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (queryid) (increase(pg_stat_statements_seconds_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__range])) / sum by (queryid) (increase(pg_stat_statements_calls_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {"id": "merge", "options": {}},
        {
          "id": "filterByValue",
          "options": {
            "filters": [{"fieldName": "Value #A", "config": {"id": "isNull", "options": {}}}],
            "type": "exclude",
            "match": "any"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {"Time": true},
            "renameByName": {"query": "statement", "Value #A": "total", "Value #B": "calls", "Value #C": "mean"},
            "indexByName": {"query": 0, "Value #A": 1, "Value #B": 2, "Value #C": 3, "queryid": 4}
          }
        },
        {"id": "sortBy", "options": {"sort": [{"field": "total", "desc": true}]}}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "total"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "s"}]},
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "calls"},
            "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "short"}, {"id": "decimals", "value": 0}]
          },
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "mean"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "s"}]},
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "statement"},
            "properties": [{"id": "custom.width", "value": 760}]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 21,
      "title": "The brain's SQL functions, mean time per call",
      "description": "Statements calling one of the brain's own functions (match_thoughts, search_thoughts_[a-z]+, upsert_thought, update_thought, delete_thought, thought_stats_summary, claim_thoughts), each by its text, among the 100 the exporter reads: match_thoughts' next to the bench numbers.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 60, "w": 16, "h": 9},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "(sum by (queryid) (rate(pg_stat_statements_seconds_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (queryid) (rate(pg_stat_statements_calls_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__rate_interval]))) * on (queryid) group_left (query) topk by (queryid) (1, max by (queryid, query) (pg_stat_statements_query_id_total{query=~\"(?s).*(match_thoughts|search_thoughts_[a-z]+|upsert_thought|update_thought|delete_thought|thought_stats_summary|claim_thoughts)\\\\(.*\"})) ^ 0",
          "legendFormat": "{{query}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Connections, by role and state",
      "description": "Postgres's client connections in the databases picked above (the brain's is openbrain): the servers' pools among them, which their client cannot count, and the exporter's own.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 60, "w": 8, "h": 9},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (usename, state) (pg_stat_activity_count{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\", usename!=\"\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{usename}} {{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "short", "custom": {"stacking": {"mode": "normal"}, "fillOpacity": 30}},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 23,
      "title": "Buffer cache hit ratio",
      "description": "Blocks found in Postgres's shared buffers, as a share of blocks read, in the databases picked above.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 69, "w": 8, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__rate_interval])) / (sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__rate_interval])) + sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_read_total{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "hit ratio"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 24,
      "title": "Database size",
      "description": "Each database picked above, on disk (the brain's is openbrain).",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 69, "w": 8, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "sum by (datname) (pg_database_size_bytes{job=\"postgres\", datname=~\"$database\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{datname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes"}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 25,
      "title": "Exporter reaching Postgres",
      "description": "up while the collector scrapes pg-exporter and pg-exporter reads Postgres; down when either fails (pg-exporter stopped or unhealthy, a wrong OB1_MONITOR_DB_PASSWORD, Postgres down); no data before the collector's first scrape of it (lgtm just started).",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 69, "w": 8, "h": 7},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "min(up{job=\"postgres\"}) * (min(pg_up{job=\"postgres\"}) or on () vector(0))",
          "legendFormat": "up"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {"0": {"text": "down", "color": "red"}, "1": {"text": "up", "color": "green"}}
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "red", "value": null}, {"color": "green", "value": 1}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 26,
      "title": "Requests not ok, and the telemetry itself",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 76, "w": 24, "h": 1},
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "id": 27,
      "title": "Request records whose outcome was not ok",
      "description": "Each request's log record (the line's fields: no key, URL, argument or thought text), newest first, each with its trace id (trace_id), which Tempo's search finds. By server alone: a path-mode canary sending here under the same service.name is among them whatever the Tier.",
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 77, "w": 12, "h": 10},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} != `\"outcome\":\"ok\"` | json | __error__ = \"\" | outcome != \"\" | outcome != \"ok\"",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 28,
      "title": "Traces with an error",
      "description": "Requests, tool calls, provider calls, store operations and job bodies whose span ended in error, newest first. By server alone, as the records beside it.",
      "datasource": {"type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 77, "w": 12, "h": 10},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo"},
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=~\"$service\" && status=error}",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 29,
      "title": "Telemetry the collector could not store, per second",
      "description": "Spans, metric points and log records lgtm's collector refused, failed to queue (its sending queue full) or failed to hand its own backends: none in a healthy stack. A loss's counter is born at its first count, which a rate does not see, so a single lost batch shows only in the totals beside this. Loki refused every record with the disk under lgtm-data 92% full (measured; its write-ahead log's threshold is 90%), which only lgtm's own log and these two panels say.",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 87, "w": 16, "h": 6},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "((sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_spans_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_spans_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_failed_spans_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0))) and on () sum(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "((sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_failed_metric_points_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0))) and on () sum(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "metric points"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "((sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_log_records_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_log_records_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_log_records_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) + (sum(rate(otelcol_receiver_failed_log_records_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0))) and on () sum(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "log records"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "cps", "min": 0, "custom": {"axisSoftMax": 0.1}}, "overrides": []},
      "options": {
        "legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]},
        "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 30,
      "title": "Telemetry lost since lgtm started",
      "description": "The collector's counts of what it refused, failed to queue or could not store, from its start: any above 0 is data a panel here is missing. For five minutes after lgtm restarts, the run before's counts are added to these (its series are still the latest of theirs).",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 87, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "((sum(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_spans_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_spans_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_receiver_refused_spans_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_receiver_failed_spans_total) or vector(0))) and on () sum(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "spans"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "((sum(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_metric_points_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_metric_points_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_receiver_refused_metric_points_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_receiver_failed_metric_points_total) or vector(0))) and on () sum(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "metric points"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
          "expr": "((sum(otelcol_exporter_send_failed_log_records_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_exporter_enqueue_failed_log_records_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_receiver_refused_log_records_total) or vector(0)) + (sum(otelcol_receiver_failed_log_records_total) or vector(0))) and on () sum(otelcol_process_uptime_total)",
          "legendFormat": "log records"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 1}]}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false},
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    }
  ]
